"外觀","A free coin a day starts once one of your cities has a level":"當你的任一城市擁有等級","A free coin a day starts once one of your cities has a level {0}":"當你的任一城市擁有 {0}級","A free coin a day starts once one of your cities has a level {0} Town Hall":"當你的任一城市擁有 {0}級市政廳後，每天可領取一枚免費宇宙幣","Next free coin in":"下一枚免費宇宙幣：","Next free coin in {0}":"下一枚免費宇宙幣：{0}後","Get Cosmo Coins (War Marks shop)":"獲取宇宙幣（戰爭徽記商店）","Everything here is free during the beta, for life if you are a tester.":"測試期間這裡的一切都免費，測試玩家永久免費。","None":"無","· {0} coins":"· {0} 宇宙幣","coins":"宇宙幣","(locked)":"（未解鎖）","Frame":"頭像框","Theme the app:":"應用主題：","Theme the app: Off":"應用主題：關","Theme the app: On":"應用主題：開","On":"開","Your frame shows round your picture, small in the corner of it on the high scores. Your city style shows on your own cities on the world map and as your castle on the alliance map. Your march style shows on your own marches (a dragon still takes its place). Everyone with a cloud save sees them. A city style also themes the city view and the app’s colours (switch that off above to keep your own light or dark). Cosmetics never change how the game plays.":"頭像框會環繞你的頭像，在排行榜上則以小圖示顯示在頭像一角。城市風格會顯示在你在世界地圖上的城市，以及聯盟地圖上你的城堡。行軍風格會顯示在你自己的行軍部隊上（龍仍會取而代之）。所有開啟雲端存檔的玩家都能看到它們。城市風格還會改變城市介面和應用配色（可在上方關閉，以保留你自己的淺色或深色模式）。外觀絕不會影響遊戲玩法。","Your rank":"你的爵位","Your honor":"你的榮譽","You’re not in an alliance.":"你還沒有加入聯盟。","Alliances need a cloud save (Settings).":"聯盟需要雲端存檔（設定）。","Account":"帳號","Realm":"領地","Total Town Hall levels":"市政廳總等級","Days played":"遊戲天數","Cloud save":"雲端存檔","not set up":"未設定","How do you want to play?":"你想怎麼玩？","You can change this any time in Settings.":"你可以隨時在設定中更改。","game. Every building, hero, battle and quest works without anyone else.":"遊戲。所有建築、英雄、戰鬥和任務都無需他人即可進行。","Ibory is a complete":"Ibory 是一款完整的","adds player alliances, invasions and PvP. There is no pay to win in it, and there never will be: the only things ever sold are cosmetics like picture frames.":"加入了玩家聯盟、入侵和PvP。這裡沒有付費變強，將來也永遠不會有：唯一出售的只有頭像框之類的外觀。"